{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人張曦雯（Kelly）近期正忙於宣傳無綫台慶劇《璀璨之城》，並捲入劇中裸戲爭議及與拍檔吳卓羲傳緋聞，多次成為新聞人物，正好引證了人紅是非多的道理。</p><p>Kelly也懶得理會風風雨雨，做好本分要緊，近日她在社交網上載一輯工作時的靚相，當中穿上一襲</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:21:45.228294+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T11:01:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T11:18:14.439826+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:18:14.439826+00:00","content_hash":"f6f0762d152a5e166774eb80ea3b9fa46f178a0373ededa702f70d37be501b28","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}